12.2 Levels (bltzread-levels)
=============================

‘bltzread-level-names’, ‘bltzread-level-faces’
     Names and faces of the five levels.
‘bltzread-level-scope’
     ‘word’ (default): setting a level changes every form of the word.
     ‘form’: only that spelling.
‘bltzread-promotion-thresholds’
     Clean reads needed to climb from level 1, 2, 3 and 4.  Default 3 3
     4 5.
‘bltzread-count-each-occurrence’
     Count a word every time it appears in the range, instead of once
     per session.
‘bltzread-lookup-effect’
     What a lookup does: ‘reset-reads’, ‘demote’, or ‘nothing’.
‘bltzread-lookup-counts’, ‘bltzread-lookup-dwell’
     What counts as a lookup (see _The card_).
‘bltzread-unknown-max-level’
     Words at or below this level are "unknown" for the jump keys.
‘bltzread-review-reject-level’
     The level a rejected word drops to.
‘bltzread-undo-limit’
     How many changes ‘bltzread-undo’ can take back.


