12.7 Reading sessions (bltzread-session)
========================================

‘bltzread-prompt-on-close’, ‘bltzread-min-chars-for-prompt’, ‘bltzread-bookmark-policy’, ‘bltzread-bookmark-name-function’, ‘bltzread-range-method’, ‘bltzread-range-farthest-source’, ‘bltzread-range-start-function’, ‘bltzread-session-confirm’, ‘bltzread-review-confirm’
     See _Reading sessions_.  (‘bltzread-range-confirm’ is the old name
     of ‘bltzread-session-confirm’.)


