12.9 Colours
============

The faces are in the group ‘bltzread-faces’: ‘bltzread-level-1’ to
‘bltzread-level-5’ (level 5 has no colour), ‘bltzread-ignored’,
‘bltzread-range’, ‘bltzread-number’, ‘bltzread-review-exposure’, and for
the card ‘bltzread-popup’, ‘bltzread-popup-border’,
‘bltzread-popup-title’, ‘bltzread-popup-key’, ‘bltzread-popup-dim’,
‘bltzread-popup-dict-name’.  ‘bltzread-level-faces’ says which face each
level uses.


